# The Relativistic Investigation Bureau — this repository tracks the
# manuscript (FINAL_REV10_The_Murder_That_Hadnt_Happened_Yet_KINDLE_READY.docx),
# its plain-text export, cover art, KDP metadata, the companion physics demo
# site, and project documentation.
#
# Deliberately excluded: the pre-git backup archive (bak/ — old revisions,
# EPUB/KPF exports, language folders; version history now lives in git) and
# OS/editor cruft.

# --- pre-git backup archive (do not touch; superseded by git history) ---
/bak/

# --- scratch scripts, caches and intermediate build artefacts from ad hoc
# editing sessions (e.g. one-off Python helpers, repackaging steps) ---
__pycache__/
/_*.py
/_*.txt
*.docx.ready
*.docx.repack

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
~$*
*.tmp
# Local backups remain beside the working files; use Git history for revisions.
**/bak/

# Temporary science and extraction helpers from review sessions.
/.course_extract.py
/.science_edit.py
/.science_part.py

# Apply repository exclusions inside the per-book folders as well.
**/__pycache__/
**/bak/

# Local generated/temporary review files that should not enter the catalog.
/Book 1 - The Murder That Hadnt Happened Yet/FINAL_REV11_The_Murder_That_Hadnt_Happened_Yet_KINDLE_READY.docx
